{"bookId":"cp-2","editionId":"6879da4e6ec271ab","chapterId":"c0028","paragraphs":[{"id":"p1a2bc50c2ae0-1","text":"哀筝一弄湘江曲。"},{"id":"pb96cf5a5eb3a-1","text":"声声写尽湘波绿。"},{"id":"pee2283f0c005-1","text":"纤指十三弦。"},{"id":"p51a707bbe5fb-1","text":"细将幽恨传。"},{"id":"p39991e872fea-1","text":"当筵秋水慢。"},{"id":"pf08277463c47-1","text":"玉柱斜飞雁。"},{"id":"pbe123a97ffd8-1","text":"弹到断肠时。"},{"id":"p82e059c0a78c-1","text":"春山眉黛低。"}]}